<% content_for :title, "Accessibility Statement — West Baton Rouge Presbyterian Church" %>
<% content_for :og_description, "Our commitment to making the West Baton Rouge Presbyterian Church website welcoming and accessible to everyone." %>

<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 max-w-3xl">

  <h1 class="font-marcellus text-4xl text-stone-900 mb-2">Accessibility Statement</h1>
  <p class="text-stone-500 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: <%= Date.new(2026, 2, 24).strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %></p>

  <div class="space-y-10 text-stone-700 leading-relaxed">

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-marcellus text-2xl text-stone-900 mb-3 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 inline-block">Our Commitment</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        West Baton Rouge Presbyterian Church is committed to ensuring that our website is accessible to
        everyone, including people with disabilities. We strive to meet the
        <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/" class="text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2, Level AA
        </a>,
        published by the World Wide Web Consortium (W3C).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-marcellus text-2xl text-stone-900 mb-3 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 inline-block">What We've Done</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">We have taken the following steps to make this site more accessible:</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 list-none">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>All pages include a descriptive page title and a "Skip to main content" link at the top of every page.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Images include alternative text, or are marked as decorative where appropriate.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>All form inputs are associated with visible labels.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Navigation landmarks and headings are used to provide a clear page structure.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>The photo gallery viewer supports keyboard navigation (arrow keys, Escape) and traps focus while open.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Color is not the only means of conveying information (e.g., active navigation links also use underlines).</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>The mobile navigation menu is implemented as an accessible dialog with focus management.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span>Status messages (such as confirmations and alerts) are announced to screen readers automatically.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-marcellus text-2xl text-stone-900 mb-3 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 inline-block">Known Limitations</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        While we work hard to ensure a high level of accessibility, some content may not yet fully meet all
        WCAG 2.2 AA success criteria. We continue to review and improve our pages on an ongoing basis.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-marcellus text-2xl text-stone-900 mb-3 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 inline-block">Feedback & Contact</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        We welcome your feedback. If you encounter any barriers while using this website, or have suggestions
        for improvement, please contact us — we take all reports seriously and aim to respond promptly.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-stone-700">
        <p>
          <strong class="text-stone-900">Email:</strong>
          <a href="mailto:office@wbrpres.org" class="text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline transition-colors">office@wbrpres.org</a>
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-stone-900">Phone:</strong>
          <a href="tel:+12253441486" class="text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline transition-colors">(225) 344-1486</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6">
        For additional ways to reach us, visit our
        <%= link_to "Contact page", pages_contact_path, class: "text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800 underline transition-colors" %>.
      </p>
    </section>

  </div>
</div>
